            {
                "entry_id": "2c4bad47-987e-388f-adbe-ad44c07041b0",
                "word": "lulu",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "c0d2650b-d449-4c0c-a308-f2bc68f8fb1b",
                        "entry_id": "2c4bad47-987e-388f-adbe-ad44c07041b0",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "lulus"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2129bd01-ce5f-3788-87e2-84022a808a53",
                        "entry_id": "2c4bad47-987e-388f-adbe-ad44c07041b0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A remarkable person, object, or idea."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "01418aa3-61b8-4d3c-8395-a75bea99619c",
                                "sense_id": "2129bd01-ce5f-3788-87e2-84022a808a53",
                                "text": "The funny part was, though, we were the worst skaters on the whole goddam^([sic]) rink. I mean the worst. And there were some lulus, too."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f911b7e0-590a-4add-9c6a-c79c3fff9a0e",
                                "sense_id": "2129bd01-ce5f-3788-87e2-84022a808a53",
                                "text": "Mon-sewer, you are a lulu!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cc3a5d99-9526-4a88-9950-791aa97eea0b",
                                "sense_id": "2129bd01-ce5f-3788-87e2-84022a808a53",
                                "text": "Seriously, I mean it: From Russia, With Love is a real wowser, a lulu, a dilly and a smasheroo."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "41b8dcdc-569d-4a00-968a-4cbbe4d1b5fe",
                                "sense_id": "2129bd01-ce5f-3788-87e2-84022a808a53",
                                "text": "The job: a real lulu. The heiress to a cheese fortune has run off with a clarinet player in a swing band, and Hicks is dispatched to bring her home."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a9912bb2-ae83-3886-a31f-15decab24ecb",
                        "entry_id": "2c4bad47-987e-388f-adbe-ad44c07041b0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A very attractive or alluring person."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
